Package: CHILE
Title: Chaos In-Silico Landscape Engine
Version: 0.9.2
Authors@R: person('CHILE', 'Development Team', role=c('aut','cre'), email='maintainer@example.org')
Description: Standalone generators for synthetic spatial fields, point processes,
    geometric features, and landscape composition. Raster outputs use terra.
    Generators run independently and support optional environmental conditioning.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0), terra
Imports: stats, graphics, utils, ambient
Suggests: testthat
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
